<template name="config-menu__career" content="career-content">
<head><style>
.career-lab { padding: 20dp; max-height: 68vh; overflow-y: auto; background-color: #101810; color: #e9eee3; }
.career-lab h2 { display: block; color: #9adb62; margin: 8dp 0; }
.career-lab p { display: block; margin: 8dp 0; }
.career-lab button { display: inline-block; padding: 8dp; margin: 4dp; background-color: #273525; color: #e9eee3; }
.career-lab button:focus { background-color: #466a31; }
</style></head>
<body><div id="career-content" class="career-lab">
<h2>Hybrid / No Mercy — Career Lab</h2>
<p>Systems prototype. These encounters do not affect Hybrid Heaven's exploration or combat. Wrestler models, attire visuals and imported animations are pending.</p>
<h2>Real No Mercy assets — import bench</h2>
<p>Original Kane portraits, mask and attire textures are decoded from your ROM. The rotating view shows real Medium body meshes. These are import checks; the full wrestler skeleton and story gameplay are not connected yet.</p>
<div style="display:flex; height:260dp;"><nomercy-preview style="display:block; width:320dp; height:250dp;" /><img src="?/nomercy/45B6" style="width:150dp;height:150dp;" /><img src="?/nomercy/2650" style="width:64dp;height:128dp;" /><img src="?/nomercy/1893" style="width:64dp;height:128dp;" /></div>
<button data-event-click="career_action('preview',0)">Chest</button><button data-event-click="career_action('preview',2)">Pelvis</button><button data-event-click="career_action('preview',6)">Upper arm</button><button data-event-click="career_action('preview',10)">Upper leg</button><button data-event-click="career_action('preview',12)">Foot</button>
<p>Audio import audition. Shop and entrance clips were recorded from your ROM; bank samples below are decoded original sound data with event names still unidentified. Audio pauses when this bench is hidden.</p>
<button data-event-click="career_action('audio',0)">Shop music</button><button data-event-click="career_action('audio',1)">Kane theme</button><button data-event-click="career_action('audio',2)">Rock theme</button><button data-event-click="career_action('audio',3)">Mute imported audio</button>
<button data-event-click="career_action('audio',100)">Sample 0</button><button data-event-click="career_action('audio',101)">Sample 1</button><button data-event-click="career_action('audio',102)">Sample 2</button><button data-event-click="career_action('audio',103)">Sample 3</button><button data-event-click="career_action('audio',104)">Sample 4</button><button data-event-click="career_action('audio',105)">Sample 5</button>
<h2>{{name}}</h2><p>{{status}}</p><p>{{perk}}</p><p>{{progress}}</p><p>{{message}}</p>
<h2>Roster and attire slots</h2>
<button data-for="fighter, fighter_index : roster" data-event-click="career_action('select',fighter_index)">{{fighter}}</button>
<div><button data-event-click="career_action('attire',0)">Attire 1</button><button data-event-click="career_action('attire',1)">Attire 2</button><button data-event-click="career_action('attire',2)">Attire 3</button><button data-event-click="career_action('attire',3)">Attire 4</button></div>
<h2>Training</h2><button data-for="stat, stat_index : stats" data-event-click="career_action('train',stat_index)">{{stat}}</button>
<h2>Shop</h2><button data-for="item, item_index : shop" data-event-click="career_action('buy',item_index)">{{item}}</button>
<button data-event-click="career_action('medkit')">Medkit / 25 credits</button>
<h2>Test encounters</h2><button data-for="encounter, encounter_index : encounters" data-event-click="career_action('begin',encounter_index)">{{encounter}}</button>
<h2>Battle actions</h2><button data-for="move, move_index : moves" data-event-click="career_action('attack',move_index)">{{move}}</button>
<button data-event-click="career_action('guard')">Guard</button><button data-event-click="career_action('recover')">Recover stamina</button><button data-event-click="career_action('heal')">Use medkit</button><button data-event-click="career_action('retreat')">Retreat</button>
</div></body></template>
